Package: scfastR
Type: Package
Title: Fast PCA, Neighbours and Leiden Clustering for Seurat via the 'scfast' Rust Engine
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Mukesh", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mukeshkbj@gmail.com")
Description: Drop-in replacements for the numerical core of the 'Seurat' workflow,
    backed by the 'scfast' Rust library (docs/RUST_ENGINE.md in the singlecell
    repository). RunPCAFast() runs an implicitly scaled PCA on the log-normalised
    data (no ScaleData() and no dense cells x genes matrix), FindNeighborsFast()
    builds the kNN and shared-nearest-neighbour graphs, FindClustersFast() runs
    Leiden clustering (RB objective) and RunHarmonyFast() integrates batches with
    Harmony (the algorithm of the 'harmony' package 2.x). Results are standard
    'DimReduc' and 'Graph' objects and meta data columns, so everything downstream
    in 'Seurat' works unchanged.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/mukeshkbj/singlecell
Encoding: UTF-8
